      "message": "You are making changes to 2 partner symbol lists using a Gmail address. This is unusual.\n\nCan you explain your relation to stmmac-platform.ko is?\n\nI think telechips / rockchip should be updating their symbol lists.\n\n---\n\nThe `-lts` branch is a staging area for merges from upstream Linux LTS branches. You shouldn\u0027t need to touch it.\n\n---\n\nIf the release bracnh `android13-5.10-2025-10` needs a fix, then it should be requested via the respin process documented here:\n\nhttps://source.android.com/docs/core/architecture/kernel/gki-releases#emergency-respin",
